ALS-LTD] (REAL_PUBLIC) is classified as an active Tantalum refiner/smelter [EDGE:EDGE-REF-SMELTER-TANTALUM-F-X-ELECTRO-MATERIALS--2E09E0AF] for Tantalum [ENTITY:MINERAL-TANTALUM] (REAL_PUBLIC), as evidenced by SEC Form SD [CHUNK:CHK-SEC-SD-ISSUER-INTEL]. Tantalum [ENTITY:MINERAL-TANTALUM] is then linked to the Democratic Republic of the Congo [ENTITY:COUNTRY-DR-CONGO] (REAL_PUBLIC) as a dominant primary-producing country [EDGE:EDGE-USGS-TANTALUM-DR-CONGO], which, along with Rwanda, supplies over 60% of global primary tantalum ore [CHUNK:CHK-USGS-TANTALUM].\n\n4.  **NPM Silmet AS** [ENTITY:SMELTER-TANTALUM-NPM-SILMET-AS] (REAL_PUBLIC) is classified as an active Tantalum refiner/smelter [EDGE:EDGE-REF-SMELTER-TANTALUM-NPM-SILMET-AS-MINERAL-TANTALUM] for Tantalum [ENTITY:MINERAL-TANTALUM] (REAL_PUBLIC), as evidenced by SEC Form SD [CHUNK:CHK-SEC-SD-ISSUER-INTEL]. Tantalum [ENTITY:MINERAL-TANTALUM] is then linked to the Democratic Republic of the Congo [ENTITY:COUNTRY-DR-CONGO] (REAL_PUBLIC) as a dominant primary-producing country [EDGE:EDGE-USGS-TANTALUM-DR-CONGO], which, along with Rwanda, supplies over 60% of global primary tantalum ore [CHUNK:CHK-USGS-TANTALUM].\n\n**Summary:**\nThe identified Tantalum smelters, including [ENTITY:SMELTER-TANTALUM-AMG-BRASIL], [ENTITY:SMELTER-TANTALUM-MINERACAO-TABOCA-S-A], [ENTITY:SMELTER-TANTALUM-F-X-ELECTRO-MATERIALS-LTD], and [ENTITY:SMELTER-TANTALUM-NPM-SILMET-AS], refine Tantalum [ENTITY:MINERAL-TANTALUM] (REAL_PUBLIC) which is primarily sourced from the Democratic Republic of the Congo [ENTITY:COUNTRY-DR-CONGO] (REAL_PUBLIC), a country that, with Rwanda, accounts for over 60% of global primary tantalum ore supply [CHUNK:CHK-USGS-TANTALUM]. These smelter classifications are based on SEC Form SD disclosures [CHUNK:CHK-SEC-SD-ISSUER-INTEL].",
